N('rules','Maximum speed for cars on open country roads with no blind corners (RA 4136)?','Maximum na bilis ng kotse sa open country road na walang blind corner (RA 4136)?',['40 km/h','60 km/h','80 km/h','120 km/h'],['40 km/h','60 km/h','80 km/h','120 km/h'],2,'RA 4136 Sec. 35 allows up to 80 km/h for cars on open country roads with no blind corners.','Pinapayagan ng RA 4136 Sec. 35 ang hanggang 80 km/h para sa kotse sa open country road na walang blind corner.');
N('rules','Maximum speed for cars on through streets or boulevards clear of traffic (RA 4136)?','Maximum na bilis ng kotse sa through street o boulevard na malinaw ang trapiko (RA 4136)?',['20 km/h','40 km/h','60 km/h','80 km/h'],['20 km/h','40 km/h','60 km/h','80 km/h'],1,'RA 4136 Sec. 35 sets 40 km/h for through streets or boulevards clear of traffic.','Itinakda ng RA 4136 Sec. 35 ang 40 km/h sa through street o boulevard na malinaw ang trapiko.');
N('rules','Maximum speed for cars on city or municipal streets with light traffic (RA 4136)?','Maximum na bilis ng kotse sa kalye ng lungsod o bayan na magaan ang trapiko (RA 4136)?',['20 km/h','30 km/h','50 km/h','80 km/h'],['20 km/h','30 km/h','50 km/h','80 km/h'],1,'RA 4136 Sec. 35 sets 30 km/h on city and municipal streets with light traffic.','Itinakda ng RA 4136 Sec. 35 ang 30 km/h sa kalye ng lungsod at bayan na magaan ang trapiko.');
N('fines','Under RA 10930, the standard validity of a driver’s license is:','Ayon sa RA 10930, ang karaniwang bisa ng lisensya ay:',['2 years','3 years','5 years','Lifetime'],['2 taon','3 taon','5 taon','Habambuhay'],2,'RA 10930 sets 5 years as the standard validity, and 10 years for drivers with no violations.','Itinakda ng RA 10930 ang 5 taon bilang karaniwang bisa, at 10 taon para sa walang paglabag.');
N('fines','The minimum age to apply for a student permit is:','Ang minimum na edad para mag-apply ng student permit ay:',['15','16','17','21'],['15','16','17','21'],1,'A student permit applicant must be at least 16 years old.','Dapat hindi bababa sa 16 taong gulang ang mag-a-apply ng student permit.');
N('fines','The minimum age to apply for a professional driver’s license is:','Ang minimum na edad para sa professional driver’s license ay:',['16','17','18','21'],['16','17','18','21'],2,'Professional drivers must be at least 18 years old.','Dapat hindi bababa sa 18 taong gulang ang professional driver.');
N('rules','Overtaking another vehicle at or near a railroad crossing is:','Ang pag-overtake sa riles ng tren o malapit dito ay:',['Allowed if the train is far','Prohibited','Allowed in daytime','Allowed for buses'],['Pinapayagan kung malayo ang tren','Bawal','Pinapayagan sa araw','Pinapayagan sa bus'],1,'Overtaking at or near a railroad crossing is dangerous and prohibited.','Mapanganib at bawal ang pag-overtake sa riles o malapit dito.');
N('fines','Failing to stop at a red light is a violation of:','Ang hindi paghinto sa pulang ilaw ay paglabag sa:',['Disregarding traffic signs','Parking rules only','Registration rules','Seat belt rules'],['Hindi pagsunod sa traffic sign','Patakaran sa paradahan lang','Patakaran sa rehistro','Patakaran sa seat belt'],0,'Red lights are traffic control signals. Ignoring them is disregarding traffic signs under the traffic rules.','Ang pulang ilaw ay traffic signal. Ang pagsuway rito ay hindi pagsunod sa traffic sign.');
N('fines','Under RA 10586, the blood alcohol limit for a non-professional driver is:','Ayon sa RA 10586, ang limitasyon ng alkohol sa dugo ng non-professional driver ay:',['0.00%','0.05%','0.10%','0.20%'],['0.00%','0.05%','0.10%','0.20%'],1,'RA 10586 sets 0.05% for non-professional drivers and 0.01% for professional drivers.','Itinakda ng RA 10586 ang 0.05% para sa non-professional at 0.01% para sa professional.');
N('fines','Under RA 10913, using a phone while stopped at a red light is:','Ayon sa RA 10913, ang paggamit ng telepono habang nakahinto sa pulang ilaw ay:',['Allowed','Prohibited','Allowed if hands-free only','Allowed for texting'],['Pinapayagan','Bawal','Pinapayagan kung hands-free lang','Pinapayagan sa pagte-text'],1,'RA 10913 prohibits using mobile devices while driving, including when stopped at a traffic light.','Ipinagbabawal ng RA 10913 ang paggamit ng mobile device habang nagmamaneho, kabilang kapag nakahinto sa ilaw.');
